   "Confirmed deviation",
   "#EE3E43 on white reaches 3.9:1, so it fails AA for button labels and body links. The system keeps #EE3E43 for underlines, progress, focus rings, icons and large headings, and uses --primary-ink #D63539 (the spec’s hover shade) for button fills and link text. Hover then steps to #BF2E32. Confirmed with the client on 7 Oct 2026.",
